      "date": "2026-05-22T20:59:05.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.02 (vs ₹0.09 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.02 (down from ₹0.09 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹134.5m (up 57% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹115.0k (down 74% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 0.1% (down from 0.5% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 31% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 23% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
